SUMMARY:Moonlight Wall Crawl
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sim Buzzard\n\nTrain from Great Malvern (18:43) to Ledb
 ury to then do a ten mile run back taking in a visit to the Berlin Wall on 
 the way. Head torch and supplies needed for the run which I think will be a
 bout 2.5 hours.\n\nTrain cost is £4.60 return (cheaper than a single)\n\nM
 aybe a drink at the end if people fancy it.\n\nLiRF: Sim Buzzard [Phone Num
 ber Redacted]\n\n10 miles in 2.5 hours target time.\n\nView on Strava: http
 s://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3436336887208176066\n\nSynced 
 from Strava Club 208705 on Fri\, 19 Dec @ 11:28 AM
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Leader: Sim BuzzardTrain from Great Malvern (1
 8:43) to Ledbury to then do a ten mile run back taking in a visit to the Be
 rlin Wall on the way. Head torch and supplies needed for the run which I th
 ink will be about 2.5 hours.Train cost is £4.60 return (cheaper than a sin
 gle)Maybe a drink at the end if people fancy it.LiRF: Sim Buzzard [Phone Nu
 mber Redacted]10 miles in 2.5 hours target time.View on Strava: https://www
 .strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3436336887208176066Synced from Strava
  Club 208705 on: Fri\, 19 Dec @ 11:28 AM
